msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parámetros"

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:6
#: of
msgid "Half-width (w) of the local spectral window used in PDS"
msgstr "Semiancho (w) de la ventana espectral local utilizada en PDS"

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:8
#: of
msgid "Number of components to keep for PLS model"
msgstr "Número de componentes que se conservarán en el modelo PLS"

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:10
#: of
msgid "Whether to scale X and Y in the PLS model"
msgstr "Indica si se escalan X e Y en el modelo PLS"

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:12
#: of
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Storage format for the regression coefficients. - ``\"dense\"`` stores "
"the full ``(n_features, n_features)`` matrix.   Fastest when "
"``n_features`` is small enough that the matrix fits in CPU   cache "
"(roughly ``n_features`` ≤ 1 500 at float64). - ``\"band\"`` stores "
"coefficients in a compact   ``(n_features, 2 * window_length + 1)`` array"
" and exploits the band   structure in :meth:`transform` via a strided "
"sliding-window view and   ``einsum``.  Fastest when ``n_features`` is "
"large (roughly   ``n_features`` > 1 500), and uses ~2–5 % of the memory "
"of ``\"dense\"``."
msgstr ""

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:12
#: of
msgid "Storage format for the regression coefficients."
msgstr "Formato de almacenamiento de los coeficientes de regresión."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:12
#: of
msgid ""
"Storage format for the regression coefficients. - ``\"dense\"`` stores "
"the full ``(n_features, n_features)`` matrix."
msgstr ""
"Formato de almacenamiento de los coeficientes de regresión. - ``\"dense\"`` "
"almacena la matriz completa ``(n_features, n_features)``."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:14
#: of
msgid ""
"``\"dense\"`` stores the full ``(n_features, n_features)`` matrix. "
"Fastest when ``n_features`` is small enough that the matrix fits in CPU "
"cache (roughly ``n_features`` ≤ 1 500 at float64)."
msgstr ""
"``\"dense\"`` almacena la matriz completa ``(n_features, n_features)``. "
"Es más rápido cuando ``n_features`` es lo bastante pequeño para que la "
"matriz quepa en la caché de la CPU (aproximadamente ``n_features`` ≤ 1 500 "
"con float64)."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:16
#: of
#, python-format
msgid ""
"``\"band\"`` stores coefficients in a compact ``(n_features, 2 * "
"window_length + 1)`` array and exploits the band structure in "
":meth:`transform` via a strided sliding-window view and ``einsum``.  "
"Fastest when ``n_features`` is large (roughly ``n_features`` > 1 500), "
"and uses ~2–5 % of the memory of ``\"dense\"``."
msgstr ""
"``\"band\"`` almacena los coeficientes en una matriz compacta ``(n_features, 2 "
"* window_length + 1)`` y aprovecha la estructura de banda en "
":meth:`transform` mediante una vista de ventana deslizante con pasos y "
"``einsum``.  Es más rápido cuando ``n_features`` es grande (aproximadamente "
"``n_features`` > 1 500) y utiliza ~2–5 % de la memoria de ``\"dense\"``."

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.PiecewiseDirectStandardization.rst
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "Variables"

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:23
#: of
msgid "Number of features seen during fit (set automatically by sklearn)."
msgstr "Número de características observadas durante el ajuste (sklearn lo establece automáticamente)."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:26
#: of
msgid ""
"Banded transformation matrix.  Dense ndarray when ``storage=\"dense\"``. "
"``None`` when ``storage=\"band\"`` or when fitted without ``X_source``."
msgstr ""
"Matriz de transformación en bandas.  Es un ndarray denso cuando "
"``storage=\"dense\"``. Es ``None`` cuando ``storage=\"band\"`` o cuando se "
"ajusta sin ``X_source``."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:30
#: of
msgid ""
"Packed band of per-feature PLS coefficients.  Set only when "
"``storage=\"band\"``; ``None`` otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Banda compacta de coeficientes PLS por característica.  Solo se establece "
"cuando ``storage=\"band\"``; en caso contrario, es ``None``."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:34
#: of
msgid ""
"Index of the first feature whose local window is fully interior "
"(``window_length``).  Set only when ``storage=\"band\"``."
msgstr ""
"Índice de la primera característica cuya ventana local es completamente "
"interior (``window_length``).  Solo se establece cuando ``storage=\"band\"``."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:38
#: of
msgid ""
"One past the last interior feature (``n_features - window_length``). Set "
"only when ``storage=\"band\"``."
msgstr ""
"Posición posterior a la última característica interior (``n_features - "
"window_length``). Solo se establece cuando ``storage=\"band\"``."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:42
#: of
msgid ""
"Precomputed per-feature bias that absorbs local PLS centering, allowing "
":meth:`transform` to avoid per-sample intermediate allocations. None if "
"fitted with X_source=None."
msgstr ""
"Sesgo precalculado por característica que absorbe el centrado PLS local, lo que "
"permite que :meth:`transform` evite asignaciones intermedias por muestra. Es "
"None si se ajusta con X_source=None."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:47
#: of
msgid "Boolean flag indicating if X_source was provided during fitting."
msgstr "Indicador booleano que señala si se proporcionó X_source durante el ajuste."

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.PiecewiseDirectStandardization.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "Excepciones"

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:50
#: of
msgid "If X and X_source do not have the same shape."
msgstr "Si X y X_source no tienen la misma forma."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:51
#: of
msgid "If ``n_components`` exceeds ``n_samples``."
msgstr "Si ``n_components`` supera ``n_samples``."

#: chemotools.adaptation._piecewise_direct_standardization.PiecewiseDirectStandardization:52
#: of
msgid ""
"If ``n_components`` exceeds the minimum window size at the boundaries"
"     (``window_length + 1``)."
msgstr ""
"Si ``n_components`` supera el tamaño mínimo de la ventana en los límites"
"     (``window_length + 1``)."

